# PIVO TECH — Client Environment Configuration Example
# If frontend and backend are hosted on separate domains (e.g. Cloudflare Pages + Render API),
# set VITE_API_URL to the backend URL without trailing slash (e.g. https://pivo-tech-api.onrender.com).
# When running full-stack unified locally or behind a reverse proxy, leave this empty.
VITE_API_URL=
